/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Visual Studio Team Explorer 18","description":"與 Team Foundation Server 和 Visual Studio Team Services 互動而不使用 Visual Studio 開發人員工具","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Visual Studio Team Explorer 2026","description":"Interakce s Team Foundation Serverem a službou Visual Studio Team Services bez sady vývojářských nástrojů, které nabízí Visual Studio","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Visual Studio Team Explorer 2026","description":"Interagieren Sie mit Team Foundation Server und Visual Studio Team Services ohne eine Visual Studio-Entwicklertoolset.","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Visual Studio Team Explorer 2026","description":"Interactúe con Team Foundation Server y Visual Studio Team Services sin un conjunto de herramientas de desarrollador de Visual Studio","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Visual Studio Team Explorer 2026","description":"Interagissez avec Team Foundation Server et Visual Studio Team Services sans l'ensemble d'outils de développement Visual Studio","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Visual Studio Team Explorer 2026","description":"Consente di interagire con Team Foundation Server e Visual Studio Team Services senza usare un set di strumenti di sviluppo di Visual Studio","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Visual Studio チーム エクスプローラー $ (VSGeneralBrandYear)","description":"Visual Studio 開発者ツールセットを使用せずに Team Foundation Server および Visual Studio Team Services と対話します","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Visual Studio 팀 탐색기 2026","description":"Visual Studio 개발자 도구 집합 없이 Team Foundation Server 및 Visual Studio Team Services 조작","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Visual Studio Team Explorer 2026","description":"Interakcja z serwerem Team Foundation Server i usługami Visual Studio Team Services bez korzystania z zestawu narzędzi dewelopera programu Visual Studio","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Visual Studio Team Explorer 2026","description":"Interaja com o Team Foundation Server e o Visual Studio Team Services sem um conjunto de ferramentas de desenvolvedor do Visual Studio","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Visual Studio Team Explorer 2026","description":"Взаимодействие с Team Foundation Server и Visual Studio Team Services без набора инструментов разработчика Visual Studio","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Visual Studio Takım Gezgini 2026","description":"Visual Studio geliştirici araç seti olmadan Team Foundation Server ve Visual Studio Team Services ile etkileşim kurun","license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=2327524","learnMore":"https://aka.ms/installingVisualStudio"}],"requirements":{"supportedOS":"6.1.1","functors":{"architecture":"x64"},"conditions":{"expression":"not Win10ThresholdBuildNumber","conditions":[{"registryKey":"HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion","id":"Win10ThresholdBuildNumber","registryValue":"CurrentBuildNumber","registryData":"[10240.0,14393.0)"}]}}},{"id":"VisualStudio.18.Release.LTSC.18.11","version":"18.11.12405.450","type":"Channel","localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"This Long-Term Servicing Channel (LTSC) includes security and high priority servicing bug fixes while remaining at the LTSC's feature level.","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"此长期服务渠道(LTSC)包括安全性和高优先级服务 bug 修复，同时留在 LTSC 的功能级别。","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"此長期維護通道 (LTSC) 包括安全性和高優先順序維護錯誤修正，但仍處於 LTSC 的功能等級。","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"Tato Kanál pro dlouhodobou údržbu (LTSC) zahrnuje opravy chyb údržby zabezpečení a vysoké priority a zároveň zůstává na úrovni funkcí LTSC.","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"de-de","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"Dieser Long Term Servicing Channel (LTSC) enthält Fehlerbehebungen für Sicherheits- und Wartungsfehler mit hoher Priorität, verbleibt jedoch auf der Featureebene von LTSC.","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"es-es","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"Este canal de mantenimiento a largo plazo (LTSC) incluye correcciones de errores de mantenimiento de alta prioridad y seguridad mientras permanece en el nivel de características de LTSC.","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"Ce canal de maintenance à long terme (LTSC) comprend des corrections de bogues de sécurité et de maintenance de haute priorité tout en restant au niveau des fonctionnalités du LTSC.","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"it-it","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"Questo Long-Term Servicing Channel (LTSC) include correzioni di sicurezza e bug di manutenzione ad alta priorità, pur mantenendo il livello della funzionalità LTSC.","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"この長期サービス チャネル (LTSC) には、LTSC の機能レベルを維持しつつも、セキュリティおよび優先順位の高いサービスのバグ修正が含まれています。","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"이 LTSC(장기 서비스 채널)에는 LTSC 기능 수준에 있는 동안 보안 및 높은 우선 순위 서비스 버그 수정이 포함되어 있습니다.","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"Ten kanał Long-Term Servicing Channel (LTSC) zawiera poprawki usterek dotyczących obsługi zabezpieczeń i obsługi wysokiego priorytetu, jednocześnie pozostając na poziomie funkcji LTSC.","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"Esse Canal de Manutenção de Longo Prazo (LTSC) inclui correções de bugs de segurança e manutenção de alta prioridade enquanto permanece no nível de recurso do LTSC.","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"Этот канал Long-Term Servicing Channel (LTSC) включает исправления ошибок безопасности и высокоприоритетных ошибок обслуживания, но остается на уровне компонентов LTSC.","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"LTSC version 18.11","description":"Bu Uzun Süreli Bakım Kanalı (LTSC), LTSC’nin özellik düzeyinde kalarak güvenlik ve yüksek öncelikli bakım hata düzeltmelerini içerir.","channelSuffix":"LTSC 18.11"}]},{"id":"VisualStudio.18.Release.LTSC.18.11.Bootstrappers.Setup","version":"4.11.24.302448642","type":"Bootstrapper","installerVersion":"4.11.24.2075","payloads":[{"fileName":"vs_Setup.exe","sha256":"db0ef41e86a9c4cc338c6684d9fce7185609c7a4081d044c52af6c0511c03819","size":5687464,"url":"https://download.visualstudio.microsoft.com/download/pr/2d4073f5-2775-4a70-8c1d-b50ae62795a7/db0ef41e86a9c4cc338c6684d9fce7185609c7a4081d044c52af6c0511c03819/vs_Setup.exe"}]}],
